# Keep LF endings on checkout, even on Windows with autocrlf:
# - *.sh run in Git Bash (CRLF breaks the shebang)
# - initdb/*.sql and data/*.json are mounted into the Linux postgres container
#   (a trailing \r breaks psql meta-commands during database initialization)
* text=auto eol=lf
# Batch files are safest with CRLF endings
*.bat text eol=crlf
